    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-02T21:17:31+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T21:17:31+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T10:47:31Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T10:47:31Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure system centred over southwestern NSW will continue to move eastwards and a high pressure system in the Bight to slowly drift eastwards. The high weakens on Tuesday allowing a cold front to move over the south of the state on Wednesday. Another ridge of high pressure follows on Thursday, with another cold front clipping the southeast on Friday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-02T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds south to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 25 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 38.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 12 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-05T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-04T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta in the late morning and afternoon. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm south of Yunta in the late morning and afternoon. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the middle of the day then tending south to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 32 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-05T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-04T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds southerly 25 to 35 km/h turning southeasterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then tending south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-06T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-07T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-05T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-06T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the far northeast in the afternoon and evening. Winds east to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending southeast to southwesterly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 37.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
